    "body": "Thanks! This looks pretty good as a start but there's no requirements in your text. You want something like:\r\n\r\n> on setting, it must run these steps:\r\n> 1. If the given value is not supported, then throw a X.\r\n> 2. Set the attribute to the given value and change the speed of playback (if the element is potentially playing).\r\n\r\n(The \"must\" requirement automatically applies to the individual steps in the algorithm and doesn't have to be repeated. [Infra](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#algorithms) has more on this.)",
